      "comment": "DETECTION (5) comes off an average effort last start when seventh at this track over 525m behind Victory Barry (31.24) in a Mix 6/7 H. Scored at his previous run. Ready to return to form. EDINBURGH BALE (7) jumped from this box last time and also the same course and distance when a 7 length third (31.05) in a Mix 6/7. This tougher but expected to be in the finish. ASTON MOSS (2) stalked the pace from a low draw last start and fought on well to finish 1.75 lengths away in second (24.39) at Bendigo in a Mix 6/7 over 425m. The form out of his last race has been franked. Expected to feature again. SCOTT IMPOSTER (4) is worth another chance despite missing the top-three here most recently.",
